      "chunk_id": "fa90b82b-0125-4233-b659-2881d28a2633",
      "content": "Policy Ownership\n\nPeople Operations owns the employee handbook, PTO and leave policy, benefits overview, and remote work policy. HR Admins are responsible for maintaining document versions, effective dates, and review cycles.\n\nPolicy updates require review by People Operations, Legal, and the executive owner when the update affects employee obligations, leave eligibility, benefits access, or employee relations workflows.",
